| EDU005 | Warn | Identifies "tín dụng" (financial credit) in academic texts instead of "tín chỉ". | Yes (requires \--doctype higher-ed) | Medium (A finance course syllabus might legitimately use both). |
| EDU006 | Error | Identifies decimal points in GPAs (e.g., GPA 3.8) instead of commas (GPA 3,8). | Yes (/GPA\\s\*\\d\\.\\d/) | Low (Standard locale rule). |

