### **Formatting conventions**

* Pricing is formatted with grouping separators (2.500.000 đ/tháng), strictly following the shared repository rules in shared/references/locale-formatting.md. Models failing to format currency properly destroy the localized illusion of the advertisement.

### **Observed failure modes**

> 1. **Illegal Ad Generation:** Generative AI instructed to write a "high-converting ad for a 3rd-grade math tutoring class" will eagerly comply and generate persuasive copy. This directly violates Thông tư 29/2024/TT-BGDĐT, which explicitly bans academic tutoring for primary students to reduce childhood academic pressure1. The LLM inadvertently acts as an accessory to statutory violation.  
> 2. **Illegal Outcome Guarantees:** Models instructed to sound "confident" or "authoritative" will default to generating phrases like "Đảm bảo đậu Visa 100%" or "Cam kết IELTS 8.0 tuyệt đối". These violate the deceptive advertising bans in both Nghị định 87/2026/NĐ-CP and Luật Bảo vệ quyền lợi người tiêu dùng 20233.

